From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:24:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Build with libcosmic single-instance enabled

Apps that embed the file dialog and enable libcosmic's single-instance
feature get a cosmic::Action::DbusActivation variant, which the main
view mapping did not cover.

diff --git a/src/app.rs b/src/app.rs
index 77aa67d..7e92d53 100644
--- a/src/app.rs
+++ b/src/app.rs
@@ -6599,6 +6599,9 @@ impl Application for App {
                     cosmic::Action::Cosmic(cosmic) => Message::Cosmic(cosmic),
                     cosmic::Action::Surface(action) => Message::Surface(action),
                     cosmic::Action::None => Message::None,
+                    // DbusActivation exists when an app enables libcosmic/single-instance
+                    #[allow(unreachable_patterns)]
+                    _ => Message::None,
                 });
             }
         };
